# Mobile quiz layout checkpoint (approved)

The mobile quiz UI (`@media screen and (max-width: 600px)` in `index.html`) is **locked** as of this checkpoint unless the user makes a **specific, explicit** request to change it.

## Do not change without explicit user request

- Progress bar / Q label / % position (`--quiz-progress-block`, top padding, progress-wrap margins)
- Chibi image slot: fixed position, `max-width: 100%`, `--quiz-chibi-max`, no right-side clip
- Current Quest panel: **fixed top** at `--quiz-quest-top: 50dvh`, grows **downward only** (not flow layout that moves the panel up/down per question)
- Question text: full height, no line-clamp overlap with buttons; answers pushed below question (`flex-shrink: 0` on choices)
- No scroll on the answer list (`overflow` on `#choices` must stay non-scroll)
- Mobile quiz font sizes for question and answers (unless user asks to change fonts)

## Never mix with broken desktop “scaling” experiments

- Do **not** add per-property `--desk-scale` / `calc(... * var(--desk-scale))` on fonts only — that makes **text** resize while image, quest, progress bar, and buttons stay fixed.
- Desktop shrink (when user asks): use **`zoom: var(--desk-ui-scale)`** on `#home.page`, `#quiz-page.page`, `#results.page` at `min-width: 601px` only, with `min(1, 100vw/1280, 100dvh/900)`. Never apply zoom or desk-scale inside `@media (max-width: 600px)`.
- The approved **mobile** snapshot is git commit **`a7faeaf`** (`@media (max-width: 600px)` block). Restore from that commit if mobile regresses.

## Safe to change when asked

- Home page mobile logo/title offset (`#home .maple-title` transform) — separate from quiz checkpoint
- Desktop-only layout (`min-width: 601px` block) — only when user explicitly asks; never change mobile block at the same time
- Share toast, results, home landing GIF, scoring in `MapleQuiz.js`, Analytics/Sheets scripts in `<head>`

When adjusting mobile quiz, read the existing `@media (max-width: 600px)` block first and make minimal diffs.
